      <tr><td>Log backfill token</td><td>Expires 31 Oct 2027</td><td>Readings missed in an outage wait instead of being rebuilt</td><td>OK, read from Cloudflare</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Usage feed token</td><td>Not set</td><td>The allowance figures stop updating</td><td>Unchecked; allowance not connected</td></tr>
